sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor H as Host
  participant App
  participant RLS as PostgREST/RLS
  participant DB as Postgres (events, settings)
  participant Cron as pg_cron new-game-alerts (*/10)
  participant Fn as send_new_game_alerts()
  participant Push as Edge fn send-notification-push
  actor P as Player
  H->>App: Create event (host.tsx)
  App->>RLS: insert events (+ event_tags)
  RLS->>DB: row saved, created_at = now()
  Note over Cron,Fn: waits until the event is 10 min old (host can fix typos or delete)
  Cron->>Fn: every 10 min
  Fn->>DB: events created 10–70 min ago, not cancelled, starts in future, not full, not approval-denied for viewer
  Fn->>DB: recipients = club members (game_alerts on) ∪ players with 2+ attended games by this host (host alerts on)
  Fn->>DB: drop: the host, already joined, silenced host, filter mismatch (surface, level, time bucket), 3 alerts today
  Fn->>DB: insert game_alert_log (user_id, event_id) on conflict do nothing
  Fn->>DB: insert notifications (new_game, data.deep_link=/event/id) for new log rows only
  DB-->>Push: Database Webhook on notifications INSERT (existing)
  Push->>Push: honours notification_prefs.push.new_game
  Push-->>P: Expo push "New game from Eastside Spikers"
  P->>App: tap → isAppPath(/event/id) → event page
  App->>RLS: select event (anon/auth SELECT, existing)
